Overarching aim: Support the Transitional Government of Sudan (TGOS), other political actors, civil society constituencies, women, and youth for a peaceful and inclusive transition in the Sudan.
To achieve this objective, the program of work will deliver support activities in three primary need- and demand-driven areas: 
1.	support to the Conference of the People of Eastern Sudan (“Eastern Sudan Conference”); 
2.	support to System of Governance Conference;
3.	capacity building and other support to Sudan Revolutionary Front (SRF) and other constituencies to effectively engage in transition processes.

