The goal of the Norwegian assistance was to support CEIC’s fulfilment of its objectives:

1.	Fostering public debate on important policy issues through publication of research findings and studies and arranging seminars; 

2.	Building national capacity  in various areas of public policy formulation and evaluation;

3.	Assisting the university in reaching its full research and teaching capacity by promoting research activities of the university staff and by establishing links with other research institutions.

