The project aims at supporting ACCORD’s general work within the two main pillars of Intervention and Knowledge Production.  In addition the project will support further development of ACCORD’s M&E work and a roster/alumni system of previously trained people that can be drawn upon as a resource pool. The objectives, activities and outputs outlined below are presented in more detail in the Program Document and in the LFA for ACCORD as a whole.

The short-term objectives for 2011-2013 will focus on conflict mitigation and post-conflict reconstruction:
