- Nurture innovation and enhance the quality of ACCORDs contribution to the field of conflict resolution by linking ACCORD’s practical experiences and peace and conflict research to add knowledge to the field of conflict management through best practices and knowledge production;
- Advance the analysis of conflict by developing programs that are aligned and seek to promote the corresponding organizational objectives to provide tools and approaches for developing c

