The Ministry will support the project “Community Safety in Somalia”, which include the following activities in target communities:
1)	Develop broad based community safety plans (CSP);
2)	Build community capacity to implement the CSP;
3)	Strengthen local conflict management;
4)	Improve safe handling and storage practices of SALW;
5)	Risk education in areas contaminated by explosive remnants of war (ERW) and land mines;
6)	Destruction of ERW and land mine stockpiles;
7)	Strengthen relationships between security providers and communities;

