Prevent and reduce incidences of armed violence in Burundi by
- supporting the collection, analysis and monitoring of armed violence to provide evidence to enhance armed violence reduction and prevention programmes;


- Supporting the sustainable social, economic and physco-social integration of vulnerable victims and survivors of armed violence.

